### BitriPay API quick reference (VS Code REST Client format)
@api = http://localhost:4000
@token = paste-jwt-here

### Public config
GET {{api}}/api/config

### Register
POST {{api}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Alice", "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "Password123!", "role": "user" }

### Login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "alice@example.com", "password": "Password123!" }

### Send money
POST {{api}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "@bob", "amount": "12.50", "currency": "USD", "note": "Lunch", "pin": "1234" }

### Resolve a scanned QR
POST {{api}}/api/qr/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "data": "bitripay://pay?v=1&t=u&id=bob" }

### Merchant API: create a payment request
POST {{api}}/v1/payment-requests
Authorization: Bearer bp_live_xxx
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": "49.99", "currency": "USD", "description": "Order #1001", "metadata": { "orderId": 1001 } }
